<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title><%= post.seoTitle %></title><meta name="description" content="<%= post.metaDescription %>">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://splitsheetstudio.com/blog/<%= post.slug %>"><meta name="theme-color" content="#171311">
  <meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta property="og:title" content="<%= post.seoTitle %>"><meta property="og:description" content="<%= post.metaDescription %>"><meta property="og:url" content="https://splitsheetstudio.com/blog/<%= post.slug %>"><meta property="og:image" content="<%= socialImageUrl %>"><meta property="article:published_time" content="<%= post.publishedAt %>">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:title" content="<%= post.seoTitle %>"><meta name="twitter:description" content="<%= post.metaDescription %>"><meta name="twitter:image" content="<%= socialImageUrl %>">
  <script type="application/ld+json"><%- JSON.stringify(post.structuredData).replace(/</g, "\\u003c") %></script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/premium.css">
</head>
<body class="premium-site"><div class="premium-shell">
  <%- include('partials/site-nav') %>
  <main class="premium-container article-page"><a class="article-back" href="<%= blogUrl %>">← Blog</a><article class="premium-article"><header><div class="pill"><%= post.category %></div><h1><%= post.title %></h1><p><%= post.excerpt %></p><div class="journal-meta"><span>By Split Sheet Studio</span><span><%= post.publishedAt %></span><span><%= post.readingMinutes %> min read</span><span><%= post.wordCount %> words</span></div></header><div class="blog-post-body"><%- post.bodyHtml %></div></article><section class="blog-plugin-cta" aria-labelledby="blog-plugin-cta-title"><div class="blog-plugin-cta-copy"><div class="section-kicker">DAW workflow</div><h2 id="blog-plugin-cta-title">Bring split sheets into the session.</h2><p>Creator and Studio launch packages include the Windows VST3 plugin, standalone Windows app, browser workflow, secure remote signing, and final PDF delivery. No separate VST license is required.</p><div class="blog-plugin-cta-actions"><a class="premium-button premium-button-primary" href="/pricing">Choose Creator or Studio</a><a class="premium-button premium-button-ghost" href="<%= appUrl %>/signup">Start free on the web</a></div></div><figure class="blog-plugin-cta-preview"><img src="/vst-contributors.png" width="1600" height="1214" alt="Split Sheet Studio Windows VST3 plugin contributor and ownership split workflow" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Paid plans include the plugin during launch.</figcaption></figure></section><section class="journal-cta"><div><h2>Ready to document the session?</h2><p>Create a split sheet, validate 100%, and send every signature link in one pass.</p></div><a class="premium-button premium-button-primary" href="<%= appUrl %>/split-sheet">Start a split sheet →</a></section></main>
  <%- include('partials/site-footer') %>
</div></body></html>
